# Your branding lives in assets/branding.json + assets/template/ +
# assets/logo/. These are NOT ignored on purpose: Railway deploys from
# your GitHub repo, so your template has to be committed to your fork to
# reach the running bot. Keep them out of a *shared* repo if you don't
# want others inheriting your look — but in your own fork, commit them.
